# DRAFT-multipledispatch-upstream-consumer-test-boundary
id: DRAFT-multipledispatch-upstream-consumer-test-boundary
title: multipledispatch 发布 sdist 与官方标签测试的分母隔离
software: multipledispatch
version: 1.0.0
phase: build|test_package|pr
category: python-test-evidence
adaptation_path: B
trigger: PyPI sdist 不含 multipledispatch/tests，但官方 1.0.0 标签包含 pytest 测试
upstream_ref: "1.0.0, commit f91547f9936e5ed368ab151c1060ee7cfe67ab79"
upstream_test_files: 6
upstream_collected: 62
upstream_passed: 62
consumer_assertions: 7
root_cause: 发布 sdist 面向安装而裁剪了开发测试；仓库标签保留完整测试源
forbid_1: 将 sdist 缺少 tests 目录直接写成上游无测试
forbid_1_reason: 会丢失官方标签中的真实测试证据并导致 PR 测试分母少报
forbid_2: 用 test_package 结果替代上游测试结果
forbid_2_reason: 消费者测试只证明 Conan 产物可用，不能证明上游回归套件通过
solution: 导出官方测试源码，构建期使用无 pytest 依赖的功能执行器；本机另用真实 pytest 复验
benchmark_boundary: benchmark 用例只验证功能调用；目标 Python 无 pytest-benchmark 时不记录性能数据
verification_commands:
  - "python -m pytest work/upstream-tests-1.0.0"
  - "python -m pytest -p no:benchmark archives/m/multipledispatch/1.0.0/upstream_tests/multipledispatch/tests"
  - "python archives/m/multipledispatch/1.0.0/upstream_tests/run_upstream_tests.py"
  - "python archives/m/multipledispatch/1.0.0/test_package/test_multipledispatch.py"
principles: separate-upstream-denominator, real-consumer-test, reproducible-build-test
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-multipledispatch-upstream-consumer-test-boundary.md
